          "path": "_m/q/q/x/f/penataran-wp/temple-dated-inscripti.jpg",
          "filename": "Candi Panataran Dated Temple, Java 1288.jpg",
          "caption": "This temple is dated by inscription to 1369. A superb kala guards the entrance, and the sanctuary contains a statue of Ganesh. The slender, tapering roof appears to be about as tall as the temple's body, whose height in turn is about 5/3 the width of the base. There is a feeling of lightness and elevation to the whole structure.",
